/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
40. 677.8899999999999864 Td
(A lease of immovable property is a transfer of a right to enjoy such property, made for a certain time, express or implied, or in) Tj
T* (perpetuity, in consideration of a price paid or promised, or of money, a share of crops, service or any other thing of value, to be) Tj
T* (rendered periodically or on specified occasions to the transferor by the transferee, who accepts the transfer on such terms.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
