(Section 107. Leases How Made) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
40. 584.8899999999999864 Td
(A lease of immovable property from year to year, or for any term exceeding one year, or reserving a yearly rent, can be made) Tj
T* (only by a registered instrument. All other leases of immovable property may be made either by a registered instrument or by oral) Tj
T* (agreement accompanied by delivery of possession.) Tj
ET
