40. 491.8899999999999864 Td
(In the absence of a contract or local usage to the contrary, the lessor is bound to disclose to the lessee any material defect in the) Tj
T* (property, and the lessee is bound to pay or tender, at the proper time and place, the premium or rent to the lessor or his agent in) Tj
T* (this behalf.) Tj
